* along with this program; if not, write to the Free Software Foundation,
* Inc., 59 Temple Place - Suite 330, Boston, MA 02111-1307, USA.
*
* START-HISTORY:
* 18 Oct 26 dm  Written: encryption layer 3 (the XE conversion; gplsrc/sd_keyring.c).
* END-HISTORY
*
* START-DESCRIPTION:
*
*   CALL !KEYCLEAR(name, removed)
*
* name     the keys of that name go; "*" empties the ring; a null name is "default"
* removed  returned: how many keys went (0 for a name the ring did not hold: not an error)
*
* The memory the keys were in is zeroed.  STATUS() 10213 and removed = '' for a name that is not a key name.
*
* END-DESCRIPTION
*
* START-CODE

$internal
$catalog !keyclear
$include keys.h

   removed = ''
   removed = sdext('clear':@fm:key_name, @true, SD_KEYRING)

return
end
